      <h2>Mid-Autumn gifts with Da Nang Go</h2>
      <p class="lede">Da Nang Go is a non-profit volunteer group in Đà Nẵng. This Mid-Autumn they collected snacks, milk, notebooks, rice and lanterns, packed them as gifts and took them to children who needed them.</p>
      <p>Our students gave 15% of their stall profits. Parents gave money too, and bid on lanterns in a silent auction. Da Nang Go's campaign reached more than 850 children.</p>
